      "writtenOn": "2022-10-18T00:54:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "A common question to \u0027BandLevel\u0027, \u0027BandCapability\u0027 and \u0027Preset\u0027. Why do we need to specify the \u0027index\u0027 explicitly? Since there is an array of all entities that can be obtained by the client, can we just use the index in that array?\n\nI\u0027m not sure what is the benefit of having the index.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 56,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 56,
        "endChar": 40
      },
      "revId": "5f80d50633d2ea02e15e9d10eb9de2e7dd770e93",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
