      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-18T00:54:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since this really depends on the ordering of of union fields, how can we prevent accidental insertion of fields in between? There must be some big comment which marks the boundaries of fields that we use in ranges, and a reminder to update the ranges if new variants are added.",
